# Gina Agency — Database Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the actual values.

```bash
cp .env.example .env
```

## Variables

```ini
# ============================================================
# Gina Agency — Database & API Configuration
# ============================================================

# PostgreSQL Connection
# Production database (sumobase)
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:PORT/DB_NAME"

# Apify API Token
# Untuk scraping Instagram & TikTok
APIFY_API_TOKEN="apify_api_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"

# Repliz API
# Access Key = username, Secret Key = password (HTTP Basic Auth)
# Untuk comment, posting, DM automation
REPLIZ_ACCESS_KEY="xxxxxxxxxxxxxx"
REPLIZ_SECRET_KEY="xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"

# === Schema (single DB, schema-per-agent) ===
# research_db   → Apify scraping, hashtag, competitor data
# content_db    → Drafts, captions, post scheduling
# engagement_db → Comments, replies, spam, DMs
# system_db     → Users, API creds, run logs
```

## Notes

- Jangan commit `.env` ke GitHub (already in `.gitignore`)
- API key asli bisa dilihat di `api-keys.md` (lokal)
- Database sudah terisi sample data untuk F&B niche
